<title>USA: Selective Insurance Q1 oper shr $1.07.</title>
<headline>Selective Insurance Q1 oper shr $1.07.</headline>
<dateline>BRANCHVILLE, N.J. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months Ended March 31:</p>
<p>						  1997	     1996</p>
<p> Net premiums written		$175,184,000    $173,447,000</p>
<p> Net premiums earned		  170,581,000     176,687,000</p>
<p> Net investment income		 24,432,000	24,011,000</p>
<p> Operating income			16,065,000	 8,611,000</p>
<p> Capital gain, after tax		  636,000	   279,000</p>
<p> Net income				16,701,000	 8,890,000</p>
<p>Operating income per share:</p>
<p>   Primary					 1.10		 .59</p>
<p>   Fully diluted				 1.07		 .58</p>
<p>Net income per share:</p>
<p>   Primary					 1.14		 .61</p>
<p>   Fully diluted				 1.11		 .60</p>
<p> Stockholders' equity per share	   32.71	     29.64</p>
<p>Weighted average shares:</p>
<p>   Primary				 14,629,000	14,460,000</p>
<p>   Fully diluted			 15,116,000	14,975,000</p>
<p>NOTE: The operating income for the first quarter of 1996</p>
<p>was $9.0 million, or $0.58 per fully diluted share, and</p>
<p>was affected by winter storm losses of $6.2 million or</p>
<p>$0.41 per share.</p>
<p>Selective Insurance Group Inc.</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
